# 约定(2026-09-23 重写, 对齐 api/behavior/v1 的 proto):
#   直连 = http://{host}:{port}, 身份由 x-md-global-user-id 头模拟网关注入;
#   网关 = {gateway_scheme}://{gateway_host}(LAN) 或 https://{public_gateway_host}(公网), 带 Authorization: Bearer {token}。
#   变量在 http-client.env.json(dev)。host 用 [::1]: 127.0.0.1:30001/30002/30003 被 GoLand/WebStorm/JCEF 占着。

### healthz(details.gorse 必须 ok —— Gorse 在 node2, 经公网)
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/healthz
Content-Type: application/json

### Track(匿名会话; itemId 用 spu_code, 与 gorse ItemId 一致)
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/behavior.v1.BehaviorService/Track
Content-Type: application/json
x-md-global-anonymous: true

{
  "anonId": "anon-http-client-1",
  "sessionId": "sess-http-client-1",
  "events": [
    {"type": "EVENT_TYPE_IMPRESSION", "itemId": "{{spu_code}}"},
    {"type": "EVENT_TYPE_READ", "itemId": "{{spu_code}}"}
  ]
}

### Recommend(匿名)
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/behavior.v1.BehaviorService/Recommend
Content-Type: application/json
x-md-global-anonymous: true

{"anonId": "anon-http-client-1", "n": 5, "offset": 0}

### SimilarItems
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/behavior.v1.BehaviorService/SimilarItems
Content-Type: application/json

{"itemId": "{{spu_code}}", "n": 5}
